{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>受一道冷鋒及東北季候風影響，本港本周中起氣溫下降，周五最低15度。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1530_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DlqGFIIpJG1794823858.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>天文台指，一道冷鋒周三稍後橫過華南沿岸，本港北風增強，晚上起氣溫下降，周四市區最低18度。</p><p></p><p>受隨後的強烈東北季候風影響，本周後期廣東地區仍普遍清涼，內陸地區早晚寒冷，本港周五進一步下降至最低15度，至下周一氣溫才稍為回升。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1530_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rGZikicwjr1794823841.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.hko.gov.hk/tc/wxinfo/currwx/fnd.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九天天氣預報</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:09.162828+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T12:10:57.735114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:11:33.899100+00:00","content_hash":"f3d65a3a7198d549bdfff29c2190fbdec21ba6608a0d5715d4dda5eb66c9bd26","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:09.162828+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}